<title>USA: Tellabs Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Tellabs Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LISLE, Ill. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.34		    $0.17</p>
<p> Net			 63,087		   31,127</p>
<p> Revs		     247,123		  172,256</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 183,655		  184,039</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: First quarter 1997 results include a pre-tax gain of $20.803 million on the sale of stock held as an investment. After tax, this resulted in a gain of about $13.855 million or $0.07 a share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
